### Day 18: FastAPI interface test examples
### Run the FastAPI server first:
### python -m uvicorn api:app --reload

@base_url = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@document_id = 1

### 1. Health check
GET {{base_url}}/health


### 2. Chat
POST {{base_url}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "用三句话解释什么是 FastAPI"
}


### 3. Summarize text
POST {{base_url}}/summarize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "AI 后端开发通常包括接口设计、模型调用、RAG 检索、数据库管理、错误处理和部署。"
}


### 4. List documents
GET {{base_url}}/documents


### 5. Get one document by id
GET {{base_url}}/documents/{{document_id}}


### 6. Ask a document by document_id
### Change @document_id to the id returned by POST /documents or GET /documents.
POST {{base_url}}/documents/{{document_id}}/questions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "总结这篇文档的主要内容",
  "top_k": 3,
  "min_score": 0.2
}


### 7. Error case: document_id does not exist, should return 404
GET {{base_url}}/documents/999999


### 8. Error case: empty question, should return 400
POST {{base_url}}/documents/{{document_id}}/questions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "",
  "top_k": 3,
  "min_score": 0.2
}


### 9. Old compatibility API: ask by collection_name
### Prefer POST /documents/{document_id}/questions in the formal project flow.
POST {{base_url}}/ask-doc
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "collection_name": "example",
  "question": "总结这篇文档",
  "top_k": 3,
  "min_score": 0.2
}


### 10. Delete one document by id
### Be careful: this deletes both the MySQL record and the Chroma collection.
DELETE {{base_url}}/documents/{{document_id}}

